# Monorepo fastproduct - ignora dependencias e artefatos em qualquer subpasta

**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Ambiente (nunca commitar)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!**/.env.example

# Logs e cache
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.turbo/
.vercel/

# OS / IDE
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp

# Playwright
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/playwright/.cache/
**/coverage/

# Tauri / Rust
**/target/
pdv-local/src-tauri/gen/

# Supabase CLI temporarios
**/supabase/.temp/

# Relatórios locais de diagnóstico (URLs/ambiente; nunca versionar)
backend/artifacts/*.json

# TypeScript build info
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.aider*

# Repositório Git aninhado (clone local dentro do monorepo)
fastproduct/

# MCP local (pode conter Personal Access Token do Supabase)
.mcp.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Backups locais de sprint / artefatos do Agent (não versionar)
_sprint-ux-backup-*/
my-agent/
